  "title": "How the Traffic Light Knows You're Waiting",
  "fb_caption": "Decoded: how the traffic light knows you're there.\nIt isn't weighing your car. At many intersections, a wire loop under the road senses the metal.\nWhat's the longest red light in your town?",
